    "phoneNumber": "+2547XXXXXXXX",
    "accountName": "John Doe",          // optional but good
    "providerNetwork": "MPESA"          // or whatever the customer record uses
  }
}
```

**Important fields:**
- `receiverAddress` = the user’s real connected wallet (this is what makes it self-custody)
- `referenceId` = your own ID (store this in your DB linked to `userId` + `walletAddress`)
- `callbackUrl` = your webhook

